# Line endings. The repository stores text with LF. These types are also
# checked out with LF on every machine, whatever core.autocrlf says, so a
# Windows checkout tests and packages the same bytes as the commit
# (test/line-endings.test.js). Everything else is left to Git: text=auto
# keeps binaries (icons, images) binary.
* text=auto
*.js text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
